id: ops-release-runtime-audit-config
title: Isolate the release-runtime audit from inherited npm script permissions
description: "With npm 11.17.0, a user npmrc containing only allow-scripts=fixture-tool makes npm run audit:release-tools exit with EALLOWSCRIPTS before auditing the separate release-runtime project. Selecting an empty user configuration with NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG runs the audit successfully. The root audit:prod already isolates this setting. Reproduce with a synthetic npmrc and retain the production dependency audit and its exit status in both configurations."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 3
tags: []
